Zombies
    Events
        Unit - A unit Dies
    Conditions
        (QuestResurgenceDead1 is discovered) Equal to True
        Or - Any (Conditions) are true
            Conditions
                (Unit-type of (Dying unit)) Equal to Zombie (Slow)
                (Unit-type of (Dying unit)) Equal to Zombie
                (Unit-type of (Dying unit)) Equal to Ghoul
                (Unit-type of (Dying unit)) Equal to Abomination
                (Unit-type of (Dying unit)) Equal to Skeleton Warrior
                (Unit-type of (Dying unit)) Equal to Skeletal Mage
                (Unit-type of (Dying unit)) Equal to Skeleton Archer
                (Unit-type of (Dying unit)) Equal to Burning Archer
                (Unit-type of (Dying unit)) Equal to Skeleton Warrior
                (Unit-type of (Dying unit)) Equal to Giant Skeleton Warrior
    Actions
        Set VariableSet Random = (Random integer number between 1 and 5)
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                Random Equal to 1
            Then - Actions
                Set VariableSet DyingUnitPos = (Position of (Dying unit))
                Item - Create Rotten Part at DyingUnitPos
                Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_DyingUnitPos)
            Else - Actions
        Set VariableSet Random = 0
        Trigger - Remove (This trigger) from the trigger queue
